/target
**/*.rs.bk
.claude/settings.local.json
Cargo.lock

# The worker-writable area inside a worktree: result.json and anything task-local.
# Untrusted by construction, so it never enters history.
.wecode/run/

# .wecode/playbook.toml is deliberately NOT ignored. It is this project's guidance
# for how work is broken down, and it describes this code — so it belongs in history
# with the code, and changes to it should be reviewed. `.wecode/` was previously
# ignored wholesale, which would have kept it out silently.
